   1203  f206							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1204  f206							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1205  f206							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1206  f206							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1207  f206							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1208  f206							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
