   2445  f79d							; for slot 1's own fine adjust. HMP0/HMM0/HMBL still hold the PLAYER's,
   2446  f79d							; the laser's and the ball's fine values, and HMOVE would apply them a
   2447  f79d							; second time — the player's fine adjust doubled (drawn X advanced 2 px per
   2448  f79d							; 1 px of RoomX, sawing +/-15 px as the fine value cycled: the "raft
